, so the effect will be compounded 5X.", "author": "one_cool", "created": 1786320864107, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "one_cool", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "A 100% Remittance Tax would Solve all unemployment problems overnight and end scam1b.", "last_comment_created": 1786345294674, "content": "<p>Remittances are money jeets send out of the country to buy businesses and real estate in their home countries so they can return as kings after looting America's workplaces.  The USA has no interest in money leaving the country, and is getting screwed.  It is so bad that the looting is supported by state actors like the Modi and the indian government who wants remittances to their shithole country to reach $300 billion dollars by 2030.  This is why Modi and the indian government push and lobby US congressmen for H1B and indian CEOs.  By simply taxing remittances 100%, that money stays in the USA where it belongs or gets taxed 100%, thus removing the incentive for state sponsored looting and the whole Jeet-1B scam industry.  All the looting and bribing and fake degree shit will be gone overnight.  Only those that want to become truly American and cut ties with their shithole birthplace of India will come to America.  One US tech job produces the GDP of five non-tech jobs, so the effect will be compounded 5X.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 11, "score_up": 179, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "stic